ou very much!\n\nhttps://ryunan-riva.com/archives/552", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KATSUZETSU_w/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c5690bd/requests/263357_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16d311fa0a1dd993d7435bfcb82888f1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c5690bd/requests/263357_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16d311fa0a1dd993d7435bfcb82888f1, https://si.imgix.net/6c5690bd/requests/263357_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=400f9834ce53f28b34983ae042fd126d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6c5690bd/requests/263357_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da353e22c07c308b4f5f9e86b94b0a32 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, I really like your use of colors, please excuse my request.\nI would like an illustration of the character I am using in my VR game.\n\nI'll leave the composition to you, but please make it energetic.\n\nhttps://hub.vroid.com/characters/8206086494046435833/models/1599695489487352964", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KATSUZETSU_w/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/09728438/requests/262353_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da1b7ad4d68adea7cb24c7cc5b46ab94", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09728438/requests/262353_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da1b7ad4d68adea7cb24c7cc5b46ab94, https://si.imgix.net/09728438/requests/262353_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=875cd227fc869713aa55c50d46d3ede3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/09728438/requests/262353_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0853b2bb79465cb26a04acce5f29e213 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI'm Tonehito, and I play video game