e request\nMeria on a holiday date in casual clothes.\nI'll leave the clothes and hairstyle to you.\nI'm not sure what to do with it.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Melia_Tamaki/status/1361478416063553537?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KATSUZETSU_w/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1dfa3516/requests/253972_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73091b7efb03431767ea89118ad43f1d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1dfa3516/requests/253972_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73091b7efb03431767ea89118ad43f1d, https://si.imgix.net/1dfa3516/requests/253972_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=639d8e7b4df8c324c2bda61a366bfa89 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1dfa3516/requests/253972_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14c9d01a12621e9f0233938434ef9bf5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, good evening!\nI saw you on Skeb's creator introduction.\nYou've got a lot of momentum even though you're just getting ready to become a Vtuber, and I'm looking forward to seeing what you do after your debut!\n\nI'm looking forward to your debut!\nI came to you from the other side of the net to ask you to illustrate my child~!\n\nI've posted a few reference illustrations of my child that I'd like you to draw on the URL.\nI'm going to say this twice because it's important, but my child is a female brother, a female brother (concept)\n\nI would like to leave the detailed specification to the inspiration that comes from the first impression of Dameko, but\nIf I may say so, my child's ankle is a proud weapon, so the composition emphasizing the ankle is a good taste!\n\nSo please consider accepting my request...!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/BdYduz0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KATSUZETSU_w/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "htt